\subsection{Subsystem Beta: Heterogeneous Acoustic Impedance and Shock Attenuation}

\textbf{Operational Objective:}  
Simulate the propagation and attenuation of high-frequency acoustic shock waves
generated by violent astrophysical ingestion events across multi-phase aggregate
boundaries.

\textbf{Governing Equation:}  
